(:id "cards/a-java-card-round-trips-and-renders-the-shared-corpus" :state :done :evidence ("tables/cards/java/test/CardsTest.java: TestCardRoundTripsThePopulatedFixture, TestCardBoundsRefuseBeforePublishing, TestParseRenderMatchesGo" "make cards-java-test, cards-java-conformance, cards-java-conformance-negative-control: load/save/render/parse/bounds all pass, no absence; one changed render byte reds exactly render") :tested-revision "974dfb4eb470fccf5aa2ed6cabc00ca28ceb7970" :note "Saved from the sprint store on 2026-10-12 (epoch 19) before the clear; landed on sprint/schema-java as 2cfc8f334f12ce82c7e525b44c0d24b960f17d11 (land a-java-card-round-trips-and-renders-the-shared-corpus, work 7c93432ef). Task: layers L1 and L2 of the card design in Java: the card record as a generated variable table with an owning facade and the customer bounds, and the brief text parsed once and rendered many times, each matching the Go leg byte for byte on the shared corpus. The facade lives in tables/cards/java (src/cards/Cards.java, src/cards/Driver.java, test/CardsTest.java and the executable driver script); its calls are the Go facade calls in the language's own spelling. Done when make cards-java-test runs TestCardRoundTripsThePopulatedFixture, TestCardBoundsRefuseBeforePublishing and TestParseRenderMatchesGo green, make cards-java-conformance reports pass for load, save, render, parse and bounds, and the negative control goes red on render only. Needs: java-carries-the-variable-form-for-card-constructs (landed), the-card-corpus-is-a-language-neutral-conformance-set (landed 1dc0631e351f, :done). Order: first in line in schema-vt-java; needed by a-java-card-upgrades-edits-and-walks-the-shared-corpus. Landed: the facade, driver and CardsTest.java are on sprint/schema-java at 2cfc8f334f12; make cards-java-test, cards-java-conformance and cards-java-conformance-negative-control re-run green at 974dfb4eb470. Stream branch: sprint/schema-vt-java (base sprint/schema-finish). Proved by landed sprint work on the stream base: origin/sprint/schema-java at cebf18f1e631c4054f08593a04b0b1ddd78fc0d9 (carried to main's overlay 2026-10-19).")
